    "title": "Woodstock alum, accomplished actress Daphne Zuniga spent some time with WUHS theatre students this week | The Vermont Standard",
    "text": "Actress Daphne Zuniga, a Woodstock Union High School (WUHS) alum famed for her roles in “Space Balls,” “Melrose Place,” and “One Tree Hill,” is currently appearing as Rose in Northern Stage’s production of “The Children,” which follows two retired nuclear scientists on the British coast in the aftermath of a nuclear disaster. On Tuesday afternoon, Zuniga spoke with and gave feedback to WUHS theatre students.",
